# Violations of the error rules (SPEC §14.1) that are accepted, one per line:
#
#   path:rule:reason
#
# path is relative to the module root, with slashes; rule is a number from 1
# to 8; the reason says why. An entry that silences nothing is reported, so
# remove an entry when its violation is gone. A new violation is fixed, not
# added here, unless there is a reason that is written down.
